            },
            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Daisy: Hi, N!\nDaisy: Would you like me to groom one of your\nPok\u00e9mon?\nDaisy: Which Pok\u00e9mon do you want me to groom?\nDaisy: Oh, okay then.\nDaisy: There!  looks a lot happier and prettier\nnow!\nDaisy: Oh, okay then."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "height": 32,
          "id": 3,
          "name": "Dr Footstep",
          "point": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "type": "npc_spawn",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 32,
          "x": 32,
          "y": 128,
          "properties": [
            {
              "name": "npcId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "dr_footstep"
            },
            {
              "name": "sprite",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "citizen"
            },
            {
              "name": "trainer",
              "type": "bool",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "name": "originalId",
              "type": "int",
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Dr. Footstep: Hi! I rate the footprints of Pok\u00e9mon!\nDr. Footstep: Can I rate your Pok\u00e9mon for you?\nDr. Footstep: Which Pok\u00e9mon do you want me to\nrate?\nDr. Footstep: Maybe next time, then.\nDr. Footstep: By any chance, you... Are you a very\nstrict person? I feel that your  really doesn't like\nyou...\nDr. Footstep: Hmmm... Your  may not like you\nvery much.\nDr. Footstep: The relationship is neither good nor\nbad... Your  looks neutral.\nDr. Footstep: Your  is a little friendly to you...\nThat's what I'm getting.\nDr. Footstep: Your  is friendly to you. It must be\nhappy with you.\nDr. Footstep: Your  is quite friendly to you! You\nmust be a kind person!\nDr. Footstep: Your  is super friendly to you! I'm\na bit jealous!\nDr. Footstep: I shall reward your  with a ribbon!\nN received the Footprint Ribbon.\nN put the Footprint Ribbon on .\nDr. Footstep: Maybe next time, then."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "height": 32,
          "id": 4,
          "name": "Effort ribbon giver",
          "point": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "type": "npc_spawn",
